Day50 Social Media Addiction Analysis
📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing Social Media Addiction patterns using Excel, SQL, Python, and Power BI.
The objective is to identify user behavior, screen time trends, addiction levels, mental health impact, and platform usage patterns.

The dataset contains user activity records such as daily usage hours, preferred platforms, sleep impact, productivity loss, age groups, and addiction scores.

🎯 Project Objectives

✔ Analyze daily social media usage trends
✔ Identify highly addictive platforms
✔ Find relationship between screen time and productivity
✔ Analyze sleep impact due to excessive usage
✔ Compare addiction levels across age groups
✔ Build interactive dashboards for insights

